        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 4707, Transitional Heritage Entry Door Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Transitional Heritage Entry Door Handleset has a timeless look that is at once modern and classic. It is stunning--a transitional decor masterpiece perfectly suited to almost any front door. The Transitional Heritage Monolithic Handleset is available in single cylinder and dummy functions. Choose from Emtek's most popular, and most beautiful, finish color options. This transitional handleset will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-4717-installed.jpg?v=1704354715\" width=\"199\" height=\"323\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Emtek 4717 Installed\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Brass Tubular Transitional Heritage Entryset Monolithic Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>UL 180 minute fire rating</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Transitional Heritage Entrance Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Height: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Height: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Thickness: 1-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Height: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 3\" please specify</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-4717-specifications.pdf?v=1704262418\"><b>Emtek 4717 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
